---
pagination: { data: languages, size: 1, alias: lang }
permalink: "{{ '/' if lang == 'en' else '/es/' }}digest/index.html"
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: digest
titleKey: nav.digest
descKey: community.digest.meta_desc
bodyClass: "cm-page-digest cm-print-light"
pageScripts: ["/assets/js/community.js"]
---
{% import "macros/ui.njk" as ui with context %}
{#- Monthly digest: ONE edition per calendar month (America/Chicago), built by community.js
    buildMonthlyDigest — the same rules as the monthly e-mail (scripts/notify/send_digest.py):
      * what was new LAST month (What's New entries + the full episode / video / document /
        announcement lists), writers from Area 65 and Texas published last month;
      * THIS month: the magazine issues (count, highlights, "put it to work" tips of /monthly/),
        events not over yet, the weekly open meetings, the Grapevine meetings count;
      * story deadlines through NEXT month, the phone story lines, Book of the Month, the
        cheapest subscription and a pointer to the daily quote.
    Plain-text versions (WhatsApp / e-mail, one language or both) come from cmDigestText.
    MONTHLY_NOW=2026-10-01 (the /monthly/ test clock) builds the October edition.
    Layout: the newsletter card + share panel (≥1024px); from 1280px the card itself has two
    newspaper columns — last month's news on the left, this month on the right. Its job: a group chat
    or e-mail. For the district meeting there is the district report (/monthly/#report): the card
    under the previews points there, and the report points back here. -#}
{%- set md = db | cmMonthlyDigest(meeting, carry, site) -%}
{%- set ed = md.edition -%}
{%- set other = lang | otherLang -%}
{%- set biLangs = [lang, other] -%}
{%- set homeAbs = '/' | lurl(lang) | siteUrl(site) -%}
{%- set PER = md.perSection -%}
{%- set prevW = ed.prev | cmMonthWord(lang) -%}
{%- set prevWo = ed.prev | cmMonthWord(other) -%}
{%- set monW = ed.key | cmMonthWord(lang) -%}
{%- set monWo = ed.key | cmMonthWord(other) -%}
{%- set igProfiles = db.instagram.profiles or {} -%}
{%- set W = md.writers -%}
{%- set sh = md.shop[lang] -%}

{#- Section heading inside the newsletter: icon tile, title (+ the other language in bilingual
    mode), an optional count. `tone` must be literal classes (Tailwind reads the template). -#}
{% macro dgHead(id, icon, tone, text, otherText, otherLang, count="") %}
<h3 id="{{ id }}" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 border-b border-line pb-2 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">
  <span class="grid size-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg {{ tone }}">{% icon icon, "size-4" %}</span>
  <span class="min-w-0">{{ text }}{% if otherText and otherText != text %}<span x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ otherLang }}" class="font-normal text-muted"> / {{ otherText }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
  {% if count %}<span class="ml-auto shrink-0 rounded-full bg-surface-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-sans text-xs font-semibold text-muted">{{ count }}</span>{% endif %}
</h3>
{% endmacro %}

{#- One Alpine scope for the hero and the page: the hero's "Copy for WhatsApp" copies the
    language the visitor picked in the tool card (bi = both languages). -#}
<div x-data="digestPage()">
{% call ui.pageHero(lang, "nav.digest" | t(lang), "community.digest.hero_sub" | t(lang), "newspaper", "community.digest.eyebrow" | t(lang)) %}
<div class="hero-actions cm-hero-tight" data-js-only>
  <button type="button" class="btn-light" data-copy-from="#digest-wa-one" :data-copy-from="src('wa')">{% icon "message-circle", "size-4" %} {{ "community.digest.copy_wa" | t(lang) }}</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn-on-dark" onclick="window.print()">{% icon "printer", "size-4" %} {{ "community.digest.print_short" | t(lang) }}</button>
</div>
{% if md.total %}{{ ui.heroStats([{ value: md.total | cmNum(lang), label: "community.digest.stat_items" | t(lang, { prev: prevW }) }]) }}{% endif %}
{% endcall %}

{#- Layout (areas/community.css .cm-dg-layout). DOM order = phone order = Tab order: the compact
    tool card (language + Copy for WhatsApp + "More": e-mail, print, the steps), the newsletter,
    then the two text previews and how to get the monthly e-mail. From 1024px: the newsletter on the left
    and a right column holding the tool card and, at the end of the column, the previews. The
    aside stretches over grid row 1 and only its inner wrapper is sticky-aside: a sticky box is
    held by its parent, so the tool card stops where row 1 ends and never covers the previews. -#}
<section class="container-page page-start">
  <div class="cm-dg-layout" :class="{ 'is-js': true, 'is-more': more }">

    {#- ============ Tool card ============ -#}
    {#- (JavaScript only: without it, copying and printing come from the browser — the text previews below
        can be selected and copied) -#}
    <aside class="cm-dg-tools cm-no-print" aria-label="{{ 'community.digest.toolbar_aria' | t(lang) }}" data-js-only>
      <div class="sticky-aside">
      <div class="card p-3 sm:p-4 lg:p-6">
        <fieldset>
          <legend class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink max-lg:sr-only">{{ "community.digest.lang_label" | t(lang) }}</legend>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1 rounded-full border border-line bg-surface-2 p-1 lg:mt-2">
            <label class="cm-seg"><input type="radio" name="digest-lang" value="one" class="sr-only" :checked="!bi" @change="bi = false" checked><span>{{ "community.digest.lang_only" | t(lang) }}</span></label>
            <label class="cm-seg"><input type="radio" name="digest-lang" value="bi" class="sr-only" :checked="bi" @change="bi = true"><span>{{ "community.digest.lang_bi" | t(lang) }}</span></label>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted max-lg:hidden">{{ "community.digest.lang_bi_help" | t(lang) }}</p>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:mt-5 lg:grid">
          <button type="button" class="btn-primary min-w-0 grow basis-48 lg:w-full" data-copy-from="#digest-wa-one" :data-copy-from="src('wa')">{% icon "message-circle", "size-4" %} {{ "community.digest.copy_wa" | t(lang) }}</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn-secondary shrink-0 px-4 max-[21rem]:grow lg:hidden" x-cloak @click="more = !more" :aria-expanded="more.toString()" aria-controls="dg-more">{{ "community.digest.more" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only"> {{ "community.digest.more_sr" | t(lang) }}</span> {% icon "chevron-down", "size-4 transition" %}</button>
        </div>
        <div id="dg-more" class="cm-dg-more">
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted lg:hidden">{{ "community.digest.lang_bi_help" | t(lang) }}</p>
          <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 lg:mt-2 lg:grid-cols-1">
            <button type="button" class="btn-secondary w-full" data-copy-from="#digest-email-one" :data-copy-from="src('email')">{% icon "mail", "size-4" %} {{ "community.digest.copy_email" | t(lang) }}</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-secondary w-full" onclick="window.print()">{% icon "printer", "size-4" %} {{ "community.digest.print" | t(lang) }}</button>
          </div>
          <h2 class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink lg:mt-6">{{ "community.digest.how_title" | t(lang) }}</h2>
          <ol class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted">
            {% for k in ["how_1", "how_2", "how_3"] %}
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</span><span class="pt-0.5">{{ ("community.digest." + k) | t(lang) }}</span></li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    {#- ============ The edition itself (this is what prints) ============ -#}
    <article class="cm-digest card min-w-0 overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="digest-title">
      <header class="cm-digest-mast flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-line px-5 py-5 sm:px-8 sm:py-7">
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <p class="eyebrow">NETA 65 · Grapevine / La Viña</p>
          <h2 id="digest-title" class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">{{ "community.digest.masthead" | t(lang) }}</h2>
          <p class="mt-1.5 font-semibold text-gv">{{ "community.digest.edition" | t(lang, { month: md.toolkit.label[lang] }) }}<span x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}" class="font-normal text-muted"> · {{ "community.digest.edition" | t(other, { month: md.toolkit.label[other] }) }}</span></p>
          <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted">{{ "community.digest.edition_sub" | t(lang, { prev: prevW, month: monW }) }}</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/assets/img/logo-wide.png" alt="NETA 65" width="128" height="63" class="hidden h-14 w-auto shrink-0 rounded-md bg-white p-1 ring-1 ring-line sm:block print:block">
      </header>

      <div class="cm-dg-body px-5 py-6 sm:px-8 sm:py-8">
        {#- The headline: last month in one sentence (+ the other language in bilingual mode) -#}
        <div class="cm-dg-intro">
          <p class="text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-ink">{{ md | cmDigestIntro(lang) }}</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted" x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}">{{ md | cmDigestIntro(other) }}</p>
          {% if md.since %}<p class="cm-no-print mt-2 text-sm"><a class="link tap-link inline-flex items-center gap-1" href="{{ '/whats-new/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ ("community.digest.since_one" if md.since == 1 else "community.digest.since") | t(lang, { n: md.since | cmNum(lang), date: ed.first | fmtDate(lang, "medium") }) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4 shrink-0" %}</a></p>{% endif %}
        </div>

        {#- Next committee meeting -#}
        {% if md.next %}
        {#- @container: date + text side by side always; the button joins the row only when the box
            is wide enough (the one-column layout), and sits below them in the narrow column. -#}
        <section class="cm-dg-next cm-avoid-break @container rounded-2xl bg-gv-soft p-5" aria-labelledby="dg-next">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 @xl:flex-row @xl:items-center">
          <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-start gap-4">
          <div class="cm-datebox grid w-16 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-surface py-2 text-center shadow-sm ring-1 ring-line">
            <span class="text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gv">{{ md.next.start | fmtDate(lang, "monthShort") }}</span>
            <span class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-none text-ink">{{ md.next.start | fmtDate(lang, "day") }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <h3 id="dg-next" class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">{{ "community.digest.next_meeting" | t(lang) }}<span x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}" class="font-normal text-muted"> / {{ "community.digest.next_meeting" | t(other) }}</span></h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gv">{{ md.next.start | fmtDate(lang, "long") }} · {{ md.next.start | fmtDate(lang, "time") }} · Zoom</p>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted">{{ "community.digest.meeting_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
          </div>
          </div>
          <a class="btn-secondary btn-sm cm-no-print shrink-0 self-start @xl:self-auto" href="{{ '/meetings/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.digest.meeting_btn" | t(lang) }} {% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</a>
          </div>
        </section>
        {% endif %}

        {#- ================= LAST MONTH + THIS MONTH'S ISSUES (left column from 1280px) ================= -#}
        <div class="cm-dg-news">
        {#- Announcements of last month (still current) -#}
        {%- set ann = md.news.announcement -%}
        {% if ann | length %}
        <section class="cm-digest-group" aria-labelledby="dg-announcement">
          {{ dgHead("dg-announcement", "megaphone", "bg-vine-soft text-vine", "community.group.announcement" | t(lang), "community.group.announcement" | t(other), other, ann | length) }}
          <ul class="divide-y divide-line" role="list">
            {% for it in ann | limit(PER) %}
            {%- set title = it | tx("title", lang) -%}
            {%- set otherTitle = it | tx("title", other) -%}
            {%- set sum = it | tx("summary", lang) -%}
            <li class="cm-avoid-break relative py-3">
              <a class="font-semibold leading-snug text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv" href="{{ it | cmHref(lang) }}"{% if it._ext %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ title }}</a>
              {% if otherTitle and otherTitle != title %}<p class="text-sm italic text-muted" x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}">{{ otherTitle }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if sum %}<p class="mt-1 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ sum }}</p>{% endif %}
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted"><time datetime="{{ it._when | isoDate }}">{{ it._when | fmtDate(lang, "short") }}</time> {{ ui.autoNote(it, lang) }}</p>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% if (ann | length) > PER %}<p class="mt-1 text-sm"><a class="link tap-link" href="{{ '/announcements/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.digest.and_more" | t(lang, { n: (ann | length) - PER }) }} — {{ "community.digest.see_all" | t(lang, { n: ann | length }) }}</a></p>{% endif %}
        </section>
        {% endif %}

        {#- This month in the magazines: each issue (La Viña first on /es/) with its theme, the number
            of stories and a few highlights (free to read first); then "put it to work" + the toolkit. -#}
        {%- set issues = md.issues | reverse if lang == "es" else md.issues -%}
        <section class="cm-digest-group cm-dg-issues" aria-labelledby="dg-issues">
          {{ dgHead("dg-issues", "book-open", "bg-gv-soft text-gv", "community.digest.issues_title" | t(lang), "community.digest.issues_title" | t(other), other) }}
          {% if issues | length %}
          <ul class="divide-y divide-line" role="list">
            {% for iss in issues %}
            <li class="cm-avoid-break py-4">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                {% if iss.cover %}<img src="{{ iss.cover }}" alt="" width="64" height="84" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-[3/4] w-14 shrink-0 rounded-md bg-surface-2 object-cover shadow-sm ring-1 ring-line sm:w-16" onerror="this.remove()">{% endif %}
                <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                  <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-sm">
                    <span class="{{ 'badge-lv' if iss.isLv else 'badge-gv' }}">{{ iss.name }}</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-ink">{{ iss.label[lang] }}</span>
                  </p>
                  {% if iss.theme[lang] %}
                  <p class="mt-1.5 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">“{{ iss.theme[lang] }}”{% if iss.theme[other] and iss.theme[other] != iss.theme[lang] %}<span x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}" class="font-sans text-sm font-normal italic text-muted"> / {{ iss.theme[other] }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
                  {% endif %}
                  {#- a meta-row: the "·" is drawn by CSS and never starts a line -#}
                  <p class="meta-row mt-1 text-xs text-muted">
                    <span>{{ ("community.digest.n_stories_one" if iss.count == 1 else "community.digest.n_stories") | t(lang, { n: iss.count }) }}</span>
                    {% if iss.free %}<span>{{ "community.wn.free_n" | t(lang, { n: iss.free }) }}</span>
                    {% else %}<span title="{{ 'community.wn.subscriber_help' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "lock", "mr-1 size-3 align-[-0.1em]" %}{{ "community.wn.subscriber_all" | t(lang) }}</span>{% endif %}
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              {% if iss.highlights | length %}
              <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1" role="list">
                {% for a in iss.highlights %}
                {%- set title = a | tx("title", lang) -%}
                {%- set otherTitle = a | tx("title", other) -%}
                {%- set by = a | cmWriterName(lang) if (a.extra.author) else "" -%}
                {%- set place = a | cmWriterPlace(lang) if (a.extra.author) else "" -%}
                <li class="relative flex items-start gap-2.5 py-1.5">
                  <span class="mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full {{ 'bg-lv' if iss.isLv else 'bg-gv' }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <span class="min-w-0">
                    <a class="font-medium leading-snug text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ title }}<span class="sr-only"> {{ "community.new_tab" | t(lang) }}</span></a>
                    {% if otherTitle and otherTitle != title %}<span class="block text-sm italic text-muted" x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}">{{ otherTitle }}</span>{% endif %}
                    <span class="mt-0.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-0.5 text-xs text-muted">
                      {% if by %}<span>{{ by }}{% if place %} · {{ place }}{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}
                      {% if a.extra.free === true %}<span class="font-semibold text-vine">{{ "community.digest.free" | t(lang) }}</span>{% else %}<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" title="{{ 'community.wn.subscriber_help' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "lock", "size-3" %} {{ "community.wn.subscriber" | t(lang) }}</span>{% endif %}
                      {{ ui.autoNote(a, lang) }}
                    </span>
                  </span>
                </li>
                {% endfor %}
              </ul>
              {% endif %}
              <p class="cm-no-print mt-2 text-sm"><a class="link tap-link" href="{{ '/read/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.digest.issue_more" | t(lang, { n: iss.count }) }}</a></p>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}
          {#- "Put it to work": up to 3 tips for this month's Grapevine issue (config/carry.yml, the
              same as the /monthly/ page), then the one link to this month's toolkit. -#}
          {%- set tips = md.tips[lang] -%}
          <div class="cm-avoid-break mt-2 rounded-xl bg-surface-2 p-4">
            {% if tips | length %}
            <h4 class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-1.5 text-lv-strong">{% icon "lightbulb", "size-3.5" %} {{ "monthly.put_to_work" | t(lang) }}<span x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}"> / {{ "monthly.put_to_work" | t(other) }}</span></h4>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">{{ "community.digest.tips_sub" | t(lang) }}</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3" role="list">
              {% for tip in tips %}
              {%- set otip = md.tips[other][loop.index0] -%}
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="grid size-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-surface text-lv" aria-hidden="true">{% icon tip.icon, "size-4" %}</span>
                <span class="min-w-0 text-sm">
                  <span class="block font-semibold text-ink">{{ tip.title }}</span>
                  <span class="block leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ tip.text }}</span>
                  {% if otip and otip.text != tip.text %}<span class="mt-0.5 block italic leading-relaxed text-muted" x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}">{{ otip.title }}: {{ otip.text }}</span>{% endif %}
                </span>
              </li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
            {% endif %}
            <p class="relative flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-sm{{ ' mt-3' if tips | length }}">
              <span class="grid size-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-lv-soft text-lv">{% icon "calendar-heart", "size-4" %}</span>
              <a class="link font-semibold after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-xl" href="{{ md.toolkit.path | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.digest.monthly" | t(lang, { month: md.toolkit.label[lang] }) }}</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        {#- Stories by writers from Area 65 (first) and the rest of Texas, published LAST month
            (db.spotlight, extra.pub_date in the previous calendar month). Left out when there are none. -#}
        {% if W and W.total %}
        <section class="cm-digest-group cm-dg-writers" aria-labelledby="dg-writers">
          {{ dgHead("dg-writers", "award", "bg-lv-soft text-lv", "community.writers.digest_title" | t(lang), "community.writers.digest_title" | t(other), other, W.total) }}
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">{{ "community.writers.digest_sub" | t(lang, { prev: prevW }) }}</p>
          {% for key in ["neta65", "texas"] %}
          {%- set list = W[key] -%}
          {% if list | length %}
          <h4 class="eyebrow mt-4 flex items-center gap-1.5">{% icon "map-pin", "size-3.5" %} {{ ("community.writers.group_" + key) | t(lang) }}<span x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}"> / {{ ("community.writers.group_" + key) | t(other) }}</span></h4>
          <ul class="mt-2 divide-y divide-line" role="list">
            {% for it in list | limit(PER) %}
            {%- set title = it | tx("title", lang) -%}
            {%- set otherTitle = it | tx("title", other) -%}
            {%- set isLv = it.source == "lavina" or it.extra.publication == "lv" -%}
            {%- set place = it | cmWriterPlace(lang) -%}
            <li class="cm-avoid-break relative flex items-start gap-3 py-3">
              {% if it.image %}<span class="cm-thumb aspect-[4/3] w-20 sm:w-24"><img src="{{ it.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" onerror="this.parentNode.remove()"></span>{% endif %}
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <a class="font-semibold leading-snug text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv" href="{{ it.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ title }}<span class="sr-only"> {{ "community.new_tab" | t(lang) }}</span></a>
                {% if otherTitle and otherTitle != title %}<p class="text-sm italic text-muted" x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}">{{ otherTitle }}</p>{% endif %}
                <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-ink"><span class="font-medium">{{ it | cmWriterName(lang) }}</span>{% if place %}<span class="text-muted"> · {{ place }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
                <p class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-0.5 text-xs text-muted">
                  <span class="{{ 'badge-lv' if isLv else 'badge-gv' }}">{{ "La Viña" if isLv else "Grapevine" }}</span>
                  {% if it.extra.issue_label %}<span>{{ it | cmItemIssue(lang) }}</span>{% endif %}
                  {% if it.extra.free === false %}<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" title="{{ 'community.wn.subscriber_help' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "lock", "size-3" %} {{ "community.wn.subscriber" | t(lang) }}</span>{% endif %}
                  {{ ui.autoNote(it, lang) }}
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% if (list | length) > PER %}<p class="mt-1 text-sm"><a class="link tap-link" href="{{ '/published/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.digest.and_more" | t(lang, { n: (list | length) - PER }) }}</a></p>{% endif %}
          {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
          <p class="cm-no-print mt-2 text-sm"><a class="link tap-link" href="{{ '/published/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.writers.see_all" | t(lang, { n: W.allDays }) }}</a></p>
        </section>
        {% endif %}

        {#- Last month's podcast episodes (a YouTube upload of the same episode is folded into it:
            "also on YouTube"), the other videos, the new documents and committee files. -#}
        {%- set media = [
          { key: "episode", icon: "headphones", tone: "bg-grape-soft text-grape", page: "/listen/" },
          { key: "video", icon: "circle-play", tone: "bg-grape-soft text-grape", page: "/watch/" },
          { key: "pdf", icon: "file-text", tone: "bg-gv-soft text-gv", page: "/library/" },
          { key: "drive", icon: "folder-open", tone: "bg-vine-soft text-vine", page: "/portfolio/" }
        ] -%}
        {% for g in media %}
        {%- set items = md.news[g.key] -%}
        {% if items | length %}
        <section class="cm-digest-group" aria-labelledby="dg-{{ g.key }}">
          {{ dgHead("dg-" ~ g.key, g.icon, g.tone, ("community.group." + g.key) | t(lang), ("community.group." + g.key) | t(other), other, items | length) }}
          <ul class="divide-y divide-line" role="list">
            {% for it in items | limit(PER) %}
            {#- Podcast episodes / videos: the shared media titles (as on Home, Listen and Watch — no
                "[Season 11, Episode 12]" tail) + an "S11 · E12" badge. -#}
            {%- set isMedia = it.kind == "episode" or it.kind == "video" -%}
            {%- set title = (it | mediaTitle(lang)) if isMedia else (it | tx("title", lang)) -%}
            {%- set otherTitle = (it | mediaTitle(other)) if isMedia else (it | tx("title", other)) -%}
            {%- set se = (it | mediaSE(lang)) if isMedia else "" -%}
            {%- set isWeeklyVideo = it.kind == "video" and (it | mediaVideoKind) == "weekly" -%}
            <li class="cm-avoid-break relative flex items-start gap-3 py-3">
              <span class="mt-1.5 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-faint" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <a class="font-semibold leading-snug text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv" href="{{ it | cmHref(lang) }}"{% if it._ext %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ title }}</a>
                {% if otherTitle and otherTitle != title %}<p class="text-sm italic text-muted" x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}">{{ otherTitle }}</p>{% endif %}
                <p class="mt-0.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-0.5 text-xs text-muted">
                  {% if se %}<span class="badge-gv">{{ se }}</span>{% endif %}
                  <span>{% if it.source == "podcast" %}{{ it.extra.show_name or "Podcast" }}{% elif it.source == "youtube" %}YouTube{% if isWeeklyVideo %} ·&nbsp;{{ "media.show_short_weekly" | t(lang) }}{% endif %}{% elif it.source == "drive" or it.source == "committee" %}NETA 65{% elif it.source == "lavina" or it.category == "lv" or (it.extra.host and "lavina" in it.extra.host) %}La Viña{% else %}Grapevine{% endif %}</span>
                  {#- a row with a link in it: gap only, no "·" (spec 1.11) — so no line ever starts with one -#}
                  {% if it._when %}<time class="whitespace-nowrap" datetime="{{ it._when | isoDate }}">{{ it._when | fmtDate(lang, "month" if it._approx else "short") }}</time>{% endif %}
                  {% if it._twin %}<span class="whitespace-nowrap"><a class="link relative z-10" href="{{ it._twin | cmHref(lang) }}"{% if it._twin._ext %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ "community.digest.twin" | t(lang) }}<span class="sr-only"> — {{ title }}{% if it._twin._ext %} {{ "community.new_tab" | t(lang) }}{% endif %}</span></a></span>{% endif %}
                  {{ ui.autoNote(it, lang) }}
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% if (items | length) > PER %}
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm"><a class="link tap-link" href="{{ g.page | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.digest.and_more" | t(lang, { n: (items | length) - PER }) }} — {{ "community.digest.see_all" | t(lang, { n: items | length }) }}</a></p>
          {% endif %}
        </section>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}

        {#- Instagram: one pointer line (the accounts post several times a day; the site shows them) -#}
        {% if md.instagram | length %}
        <p class="cm-dg-line cm-avoid-break relative flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-2 px-4 py-3 text-sm">
          <span class="grid size-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-grape-soft text-grape">{% icon "instagram", "size-4" %}</span>
          <span class="min-w-0"><a class="link font-semibold after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-xl" href="{{ '/instagram/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.digest.ig_line" | t(lang) }}</a>
          <span class="block text-xs text-muted">{% for p in md.instagram %}@{{ p.username }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</span></span>
        </p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if not md.total and not W.total %}{{ ui.emptyState("coffee", "community.digest.quiet_title" | t(lang), "community.digest.quiet_text" | t(lang, { prev: prevW }), "/whats-new/" | lurl(lang), "nav.whats_new" | t(lang)) }}{% endif %}
        </div>

        {#- ================= THIS MONTH (right column from 1280px) ================= -#}
        <div class="cm-dg-side">
        {#- Coming up this month: events not over yet (the committee meeting has its box above;
            a monthly series once), the weekly open meetings, the Grapevine meetings near you. -#}
        <section class="cm-digest-group" aria-labelledby="dg-events">
          {{ dgHead("dg-events", "calendar-days", "bg-vine-soft text-vine", "community.digest.coming_month" | t(lang, { month: monW }), "community.digest.coming_month" | t(other, { month: monWo }), other) }}
          {% if md.events | length %}
          <ul class="divide-y divide-line" role="list">
            {% for ev in md.events %}
            {%- set title = ev | tx("title", lang) -%}
            {%- set otherTitle = ev | tx("title", other) -%}
            <li class="cm-avoid-break relative flex items-start gap-4 py-3">
              <span class="cm-datebox grid w-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-surface-2 py-1.5 text-center">
                {#- "APR–MAY" / "30–2" for an event over several days that ends in another month -#}
                {%- set monthBox = ev | cmEventMonthBox(lang) -%}
                <span class="whitespace-nowrap {{ 'text-[0.55rem] tracking-normal' if '–' in monthBox else 'text-[0.62rem] tracking-wider' }} font-bold uppercase text-vine">{{ monthBox }}</span>
                {%- set dayBox = ev | cmEventDayBox(lang) -%}
                <span class="font-display {{ 'text-sm' if '–' in dayBox else 'text-lg' }} whitespace-nowrap font-semibold leading-none text-ink">{{ dayBox }}</span>
              </span>
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                {% if ev.url %}<a class="font-semibold leading-snug text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv" href="{{ ev | cmHref(lang) }}"{% if ev._ext %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ title }}</a>{% else %}<span class="font-semibold text-ink">{{ title }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% if otherTitle and otherTitle != title %}<p class="text-sm italic text-muted" x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}">{{ otherTitle }}</p>{% endif %}
                {%- set where = ev | cmEventWhere(lang) -%}
                <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-muted">{{ ev | cmEventWhen(lang) }}{% if ev._recurring %} ·&nbsp;<span class="whitespace-nowrap">{% icon "repeat", "inline size-3 align-[-0.1em]" %} {{ "community.digest.every_month" | t(lang) }}</span>{% endif %}{% if where %} ·&nbsp;<span{% if ev.extra.location_tba %} class="italic"{% endif %}>{{ where }}</span>{% endif %} {{ ui.autoNote(ev, lang) }}</p>
                {% if ev._tentative %}<p class="mt-1">{{ ui.tentativeBadge(lang) }}</p>{% endif %}
              </div>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% else %}
          <p class="py-3 text-sm text-muted">{{ "community.digest.no_events" | t(lang, { month: monW }) }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          {#- Every week: the Grapevine Weekly Open / La Viña's open meeting (the /monthly/ model) -#}
          {%- set weekly = md.weekly[lang] -%}
          {% if weekly | length %}
          <ul class="divide-y divide-line border-t border-line" role="list">
            {% for w in weekly %}
            <li class="cm-avoid-break relative flex items-start gap-4 py-3">
              <span class="grid w-12 shrink-0 place-items-center self-stretch rounded-lg bg-surface-2 text-grape" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "repeat", "size-4" %}</span>
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <a class="font-semibold leading-snug text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv" href="{{ '/meetings/#weekly-open' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ w.title }}</a>
                <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-muted"><span class="font-semibold text-grape">{{ "community.digest.every_week" | t(lang) }}</span> · {{ w.when }}{% if w.startsLabel %} · {{ "monthly.weekly_from" | t(lang, { date: w.startsLabel }) }}{% endif %}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}
          {#- Grapevine meetings near you: the count only; the meetings have ONE home, /meetings/ -#}
          {%- set g = md.gvm[lang] -%}
          {% if g.inArea %}
          <div class="cm-avoid-break relative flex items-start gap-4 border-t border-line py-3">
            <span class="grid w-12 shrink-0 place-items-center self-stretch rounded-lg bg-surface-2 py-2 text-gv" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "map-pin", "size-4" %}</span>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <a class="font-semibold leading-snug text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv" href="{{ '/meetings/#grapevine-meetings' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.digest.gvm_title" | t(lang) }}</a>
              <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-muted">{{ g | cmGvmText(lang) }}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <p class="cm-no-print mt-1 text-sm"><a class="link tap-link" href="{{ '/events/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.digest.events_link" | t(lang) }}</a></p>
        </section>

        {#- Share your story: deadlines through the end of next month, La Viña's open topics (the /monthly/
            model's 3 of the month), the magazines' phone story lines (db.audio_project). -#}
        {%- set lvTopics = md.lvTopics[lang] -%}
        {% if md.deadlines | length or lvTopics | length or md.audio.gv or md.audio.lv %}
        <section class="cm-digest-group" aria-labelledby="dg-deadlines">
          {{ dgHead("dg-deadlines", "pen-line", "bg-lv-soft text-lv", "community.digest.deadlines" | t(lang), "community.digest.deadlines" | t(other), other) }}
          {% if md.deadlines | length %}
          <ul class="divide-y divide-line" role="list">
            {% for d in md.deadlines %}
            {%- set dLv = d.extra.publication == "lv" -%}
            <li class="cm-avoid-break py-3">
              <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">{{ d | tx("title", lang) }}</p>
              {% if (d | tx("title", other)) != (d | tx("title", lang)) %}<p class="text-sm italic text-muted" x-show="bi" x-cloak lang="{{ other }}">{{ d | tx("title", other) }}</p>{% endif %}
              <p class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-sm">
                <span class="{{ 'badge-lv' if dLv else 'badge-gv' }}">{{ "La Viña" if dLv else "Grapevine" }}</span>
                <span class="text-muted">{{ d | cmItemIssue(lang) }}</span>
                <span class="inline-flex gap-x-2 whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-lv-strong"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-normal text-faint">·</span>{{ "community.digest.deadline_due" | t(lang, { date: d.extra.deadline | fmtDate(lang, "medium") }) }}</span>
                {{ ui.autoNote(d, lang) }}
              </p>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}
          {% if lvTopics | length %}
          {#- La Viña's suggested themes never close — three of them, rotating by month (as on /monthly/) -#}
          <div class="cm-avoid-break mt-3 rounded-xl bg-lv-soft/60 p-4">
            <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-sm"><span class="badge-lv">La Viña</span><span class="text-ink">{{ "community.digest.lv_anytime" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1" role="list">
              {% for d in lvTopics %}
              <li class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">“{{ d.text }}”{% if lang != "es" and d.es and d.es != d.text %} <span class="font-sans text-sm font-normal italic text-muted" lang="es">— {{ d.es }}</span>{% endif %}</li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if md.audio.gv or md.audio.lv %}
          {#- Record your story by phone: the numbers are tap-to-call; the steps live on /contribute/#record -#}
          <div class="cm-avoid-break mt-3 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-2 p-4">
            <span class="grid size-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-grape-soft text-grape" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "mic", "size-4" %}</span>
            <div class="min-w-0 text-sm">
              <p class="font-semibold text-ink">{{ "community.rec.title" | t(lang) }}</p>
              <p class="mt-0.5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-3">
                {% for pub in (["lv", "gv"] if lang == "es" else ["gv", "lv"]) %}{% set d = md.audio[pub] %}{% if d %}
                <span class="whitespace-nowrap text-muted">{{ "La Viña" if pub == "lv" else "Grapevine" }}: <a class="link tap-link font-semibold" href="tel:{{ d.tel }}">{{ d.phone }}</a></span>
                {% endif %}{% endfor %}
              </p>
              <p class="cm-no-print"><a class="link tap-link" href="{{ '/contribute/#record' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "community.rec.jump" | t(lang) }}</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <p class="cm-no-print mt-3 text-sm"><a class="link tap-link" href="{{ '/contribute/' | lurl(lang) }}">{{ "nav.contribute" | t(lang) }}</a></p>
        </section>
        {% endif %}

        {#- Book of the Month: a compact teaser of db.shop.botm (title, sale price, last day; the title opens
            the official store). Prices and dates have ONE home, /shop/#botm — linked, never repeated in full. -#}
        {% if sh.offers | length %}
        <section class="cm-digest-group" aria-labelledby="dg-botm">
          {%- set botmKey = "community.digest.botm_title" if sh.pct else "community.digest.botm_title_plain" -%}
          {{ dgHead("dg-botm", "book-open", "bg-grape-soft text-grape", botmKey | t(lang, { pct: sh.pct }), botmKey | t(other, { pct: sh.pct }), other) }}
          <ul class="divide-y divide-line" role="list">
            {% for o in sh.offers %}
            <li class="cm-avoid-break relative flex items-start gap-3 py-3">
              {% if o.image %}<img src="{{ o.image }}" alt="" width="40" height="56" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-10 shrink-0 rounded-sm bg-surface-2 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-line" onerror="this.remove()">{% endif %}
              <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                <a class="font-semibold leading-snug text-ink no-underline after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-gv" href="{{ o.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span lang="{{ o.titleLang }}">{{ o.title }}</span><span class="sr-only"> — {{ o.host }} {{ "community.new_tab" | t(lang) }}</span></a>
                {% if o.gloss %}<span class="block text-xs text-muted">{{ o.gloss }}</span>{% endif %}
                <p class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-0.5 text-xs text-muted">
                  <span class="{{ 'badge-lv' if o.isLv else 'badge-gv' }}">{{ o.pubName }}</span>
                  {#- price · until …: a meta-row (the "·" is drawn by CSS and never starts a line) -#}
                  <span class="meta-row"><span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{{ o.sale }}</span>{% if o.price %} {{ "community.digest.botm_regular" | t(lang, { price: o.price }) }}{% endif %}</span>
                  {% if o.endsLabel %}<time datetime="{{ o.ends }}">{{ "community.digest.botm_ends" | t(lang, { date: o.endsLabel }) }}</time>{% endif %}</span>
                  {% if o.machine and o.gloss %}<span class="auto-note" title="{{ 'common.auto_translated_help' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "languages", "size-3" %} {{ "common.auto_translated" | t(lang) }}</span>{% endif %}
                </p>
              </div>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <p class="cm-no-print mt-1 text-sm"><a class="link tap-link" href="{{ '/shop/' | lurl(lang) }}#botm">{{ "community.digest.botm_more" | t(lang) }}</a></p>
        </section>
        {% endif %}
        {#- The cheapest subscription ("Subscriptions from $2.99 a month" — the prices live on /shop/) -#}
        {% if md.subsFrom %}
        <p class="cm-dg-line cm-avoid-break relative flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-2 px-4 py-3 text-sm">
          <span class="grid size-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-lv-soft text-lv">{% icon "newspaper", "size-4" %}</span>
          <a class="link font-semibold after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-xl" href="{{ '/shop/' | lurl(lang) }}#subscriptions">{{ "shop.subs_from" | t(lang, { amount: md.subsFrom | shopMoney(lang) }) }}</a>
        </p>
        {% endif %}

        {#- The daily quote: a pointer to the home page (the quote itself changes every morning there) -#}
        {% if md.quote %}
        <p class="cm-dg-line cm-avoid-break relative flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-2 px-4 py-3 text-sm">
          <span class="grid size-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-gv-soft text-gv">{% icon "quote", "size-4" %}</span>
          <span class="min-w-0"><span class="block text-ink">{{ "community.digest.quote_line" | t(lang) }}</span>
          <a class="link font-semibold after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-xl" href="{{ '/' | lurl(lang) }}#quote-title">{{ "community.digest.quote_link" | t(lang) }}</a></span>
        </p>
        {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer class="flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-line bg-surface-2/50 px-5 py-5 sm:px-8">
        <span class="cm-qr-sm size-20 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white p-1 ring-1 ring-line">{{ homeAbs | qrSvg("", "size-full") | safe }}</span>
        <div class="min-w-0 text-sm">
          <p class="font-semibold text-ink">{{ "community.digest.scan" | t(lang) }}</p>
          {#- the address breaks after the site's name ("mkp715.github.io/" + "AAGrapevine/es"), never inside a word -#}
          {%- set su = homeAbs | cmShortUrl -%}{%- set cut = su.indexOf("/") %}
          <p class="text-gv [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">{% if cut > 0 %}{{ su.slice(0, cut + 1) }}<wbr><span class="whitespace-nowrap">{{ su.slice(cut + 1) }}</span>{% else %}{{ su }}{% endif %}</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">{{ "community.digest.generated" | t(lang, { date: site.built | fmtDate(lang, "medium") }) }}</p>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </article>

    {#- ============ Text previews (also the copy sources: #digest-wa-* / #digest-email-*) ============ -#}
    <div id="dg-previews" class="cm-dg-previews cm-no-print card divide-y divide-line overflow-hidden">
      <details class="cm-preview">
        <summary class="flex min-h-12 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{% icon "message-circle", "size-4 text-vine" %} {{ "community.digest.preview" | t(lang) }}</summary>
        <pre id="digest-wa-one" class="cm-pre" x-show="!bi" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ 'community.digest.wa_label' | t(lang) }} ({{ 'community.digest.lang_only' | t(lang) }})">{{ md | cmDigestText([lang], "whatsapp", site) }}</pre>
        <pre id="digest-wa-bi" class="cm-pre" x-show="bi" x-cloak role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ 'community.digest.wa_label' | t(lang) }} ({{ 'community.digest.lang_bi' | t(lang) }})">{{ md | cmDigestText(biLangs, "whatsapp", site) }}</pre>
      </details>
      <details class="cm-preview">
        <summary class="flex min-h-12 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{% icon "mail", "size-4 text-gv" %} {{ "community.digest.preview_email" | t(lang) }}</summary>
        <pre id="digest-email-one" class="cm-pre" x-show="!bi" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ 'community.digest.email_label' | t(lang) }} ({{ 'community.digest.lang_only' | t(lang) }})">{{ md | cmDigestText([lang], "email", site) }}</pre>
        <pre id="digest-email-bi" class="cm-pre" x-show="bi" x-cloak role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ 'community.digest.email_label' | t(lang) }} ({{ 'community.digest.lang_bi' | t(lang) }})">{{ md | cmDigestText(biLangs, "email", site) }}</pre>
      </details>
      {#- How to receive it: the monthly e-mail goes to the committee's list — ask the chair -#}
      <div class="px-4 py-3.5">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{{ "community.sub.email_title" | t(lang) }}</h2>
        <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "community.sub.email_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
        <a class="link tap-link mt-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ (site.meeting.chair_email or site.contact_email) | cmMailto('community.sub.email_subject' | t(lang)) }}">{% icon "mail", "size-4 shrink-0" %} {{ "community.sub.email_btn" | t(lang) }}</a>
      </div>
      {#- One job each: this digest is for a group chat or e-mail; the district meeting has its own
          report (/monthly/#report, which points back here) -#}
      <div class="px-4 py-3.5">
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "community.digest.report_hint" | t(lang) }}</p>
        <a class="link tap-link mt-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold" href="{{ '/monthly/' | lurl(lang) }}#report">{% icon "clipboard-list", "size-4 shrink-0" %} {{ "community.digest.report_link" | t(lang) }}<span aria-hidden="true"> →</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</div>
